WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.361
Look closely at a Flexi column.

00:00:04.641 --> 00:00:08.228
Those slots are the reason it can become almost any workstation.

00:00:08.828 --> 00:00:10.768
Fixed workstations are set once.

00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:16.852
When the task, operator or product changes, the shelves and worktop stay exactly where they were.

00:00:17.132 --> 00:00:20.798
Then you either live with a poor setup, or you buy new furniture.

00:00:21.398 --> 00:00:27.755
Each Flexi column has one large macro slot in the centre and two small micro slots beside it,

00:00:27.755 --> 00:00:28.644
on each side.

00:00:28.924 --> 00:00:34.957
Macro slots carry heavy parts such as worktops and steel shelves, adjustable in 3 inch steps.

00:00:35.237 --> 00:00:41.267
Micro slots carry lighter parts such as power beams, bin rails and variable-angle shelves,

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:43.076
adjustable in 1 inch steps.

00:00:43.356 --> 00:00:49.410
Columns are double-sided too, so one column can carry parts for the workstation behind it as well.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.714
On a Furnisys Flexi workstation,

00:00:52.714 --> 00:00:59.050
a steel shelf carries 136 kilos in macro slots and 68 kilos in micro slots.

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:01.893
Two slot sizes, endless setups.

00:01:02.173 --> 00:01:03.400
What would you move first?

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:07.442
Comment below, and next, see the six layouts Flexi can form.

00:01:08.042 --> 00:01:12.287
Furnisys: complete workspace systems, planned around your process.

